              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "山村 — shāncūn — \"mountain village\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "tā zhù zài yí ge xiǎo shāncūn — He lives in a little mountain village."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The new character, in pieces: 村 (cūn) — seven strokes in two pieces: on the left the tree piece of 机, four strokes; on the right the right piece of 对, three strokes. The next lesson puts it in your hand."
            }
          ]
        },
